#N canvas 0 50 900 640 12;
#X text 20 10 adi-transport-proof -- [adi.transport] end to end (ADR-0188 d3). Each of the seven outlets writes its own cell \, so the test reads back the whole field list rather than one value that might have been a coincidence.;
